\begin{abstract}
This thesis presents a comprehensive engineering framework for designing, validating, and producing
high-complexity electronic systems, including advanced microarchitectures, embedded platforms, and
specialized compute modules. The work covers system-level architecture, schematic development,
high-speed PCB layout, signal and power integrity simulation, manufacturing documentation, and
production readiness. The methodology reflects modern industry standards for high-density,
high-performance hardware systems.
\end{abstract}

